子」","textMapHash":2760057466,"text":"にゃおーん、この石、いつになったらうちと同じ姿になるにゃ…","nextNodeIds":[722150102]},{"nodeId":722150102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4030925170,"text":"彫刻はどうなった？","nextNodeIds":[722150103]},{"nodeId":722150103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":1346972402,"text":"あの石人間が、あとしばらくしたら完成すると言っていたにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150104]},{"nodeId":722150104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":867552762,"text":"響が帰ってきたら、きっと喜ぶ。","nextNodeIds":[722150105]},{"nodeId":722150105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":619525738,"text":"それと、石を作る以外に、神社もキレイにしないといけないにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150106]},{"nodeId":722150106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":3411177850,"text":"主ら、この丸くて音がする鉄球を神社の周りにかけてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[722150107]},{"nodeId":722150107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":187567394,"text":"これは響が以前準備していたものにゃ。たしか、うちとあの子らのことが好きだった響のために、百目鬼が贈ったもの、探し出すのに苦労したにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150108]},{"nodeId":722150108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1864977530,"text":"これは…鈴？","nextNodeIds":[722150109]},{"nodeId":722150109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":2231353410,"text":"「鈴」？うちはわからない…でも響が昔、その鉄球を使ってよくうちと遊んでいたにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150110]},{"nodeId":722150110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":3973785698,"text":"その鉄球を地面に置いて、遠くに飛ばす。鉄球が動いてるときは、音が鳴るにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150111]},{"nodeId":722150111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":2479737514,"text":"鉄球にどんな力があるか知らにゃいが、その音はうちと他の猫たちを引きつけるにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150112]},{"nodeId":722150112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":2961944226,"text":"だから、うちはわかったにゃ。神社に人が来ないのは、その鉄球がないからにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150113]},{"nodeId":722150113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":132139626,"text":"主ら、この鉄球を高いところに飾るにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150114]},{"nodeId":722150114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":2080037754,"text":"そうしたら、人間は鉄球の音を聞き、神社に来ることができるにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150115]},{"nodeId":722150115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":2888199362,"text":"「賽銭箱」にもお金がたくさん入り、神社も賑やかになる。そしたら響も喜ぶにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150116]},{"nodeId":722150116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":4178504730,"text":"だから、その鉄球を神社の周りに飾ってくれにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[722150117]},{"nodeId":722150117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1015326210,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[722150118]},{"nodeId":722150118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3189,"speakerName":"「寝子」","textMapHash":3907229690,"text":"頼んだにゃ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7221502,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","